@startuml
title ローカル開発環境の配置図

node "Developer Machine" {
  node "Docker Compose" {
    node "front service\nengineer-quest-front" as Front {
      component "Next.js dev server\n:3000" as Next
    }

    node "back service\nengineer-quest-back" as Back {
      component "Express API\n:8080" as Express
      component "Prisma Client" as Prisma
    }
  }

  database "PostgreSQL\nDATABASE_URL" as DB
}

cloud "Firebase Project" {
  component "Firebase Auth" as Firebase
}

Next --> Express : http://localhost:8080/api を呼び出す
Next --> Firebase : クライアント側で認証する
Express --> Firebase : Admin SDK で token を検証する
Express --> Prisma : DB アクセスを依頼する
Prisma --> DB : SQL を実行する

note right of Front
  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
end note

note right of Back
  ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
  GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS は
  Firebase Admin SDK の認証に使う。
end note

@enduml
